# Minecraft 2D

A simple 2D Minecraft-inspired game built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

## Features

- 🌍 Random world generation
- 🌳 Random cherry trees
- ⛏️ Four tools:
  - Pickaxe
  - Axe
  - Shovel
  - Sword
- 💎 Mine different ores:
  - Diamond
  - Gold
  - Emerald
- 🎒 Inventory system
- 🔢 Item quantity counter
- ⌨️ Tool selection using keys (1-4)
- 🖱️ Place blocks from the inventory

## Controls

| Key | Tool |
|------|------|
| 1 | Pickaxe |
| 2 | Axe |
| 3 | Shovel |
| 4 | Sword |

## Built With

- HTML5
- CSS
- JavaScript

## Project Structure

